{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddf5 Enter the Labyrinth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asterion is a rogue-like action-adventure set in the mythological Labyrinth of Knossos.<br>Play as <strong>Theseus</strong>, guided by <strong>Ariadne</strong>, and explore a shifting maze full of traps, spirits, and forgotten secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Environmental puzzles inspired by Daedalus\u2019 inventions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf5 Procedurally generated labyrinth floors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7b Enemies from Greek myth: shades, animated statues...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddea Mythical artifacts: Ares' Rage, Eolus' Claw, Icarus' Wings...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f Atmospheric storytelling through voice lines and cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 A unique visual style inspired by ancient frescoes and modern indie games</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfaf A Game of Choice and Consequence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not just fighting the Minotaur \u2014 you\u2019re fighting your fate.<br>Each run uncovers new fragments of the myth, as you piece together your destiny.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Steps in the Maze","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3790990/982f13b1c1ffb9ac15e891f0e9bf91aa77e5f699.jpg"},{"name":"Threads of Fate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3790990/0d6fada45b1f0ecb39df30b8c27a3faca1cec0ba.jpg"},{"name":"Deal with the Inventor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3790990/cab58e38cbea195aee43eaa39607410fac7b1edb.jpg"},{"name":"Face Your Fate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcom